{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a meditative game that refers you to village life with its everyday life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game presents the different activities that characterize life in a village colony on Mars, as well as the difficulties that prevent the village from being rebuilt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/cabb6703c2300a033e02ce03e286d586.poster.avif?t=1745946268\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/cabb6703c2300a033e02ce03e286d586.webm?t=1745946268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/cabb6703c2300a033e02ce03e286d586.mp4?t=1745946268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Unique Setting:</i> Create a unique community where modern technology merges with traditional Russian culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/15bb3b05feafe9f01b4517d3e4957e4c.poster.avif?t=1745946268\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/15bb3b05feafe9f01b4517d3e4957e4c.webm?t=1745946268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/15bb3b05feafe9f01b4517d3e4957e4c.mp4?t=1745946268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Variety of Activities:</i> Farm, raise livestock and poultry, build structures, fish, gather mushrooms, berries and more. Life in a village won't let you get bored!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/2494fbd975e31ed867b4683dfbd6aa27.poster.avif?t=1745946268\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/2494fbd975e31ed867b4683dfbd6aa27.webm?t=1745946268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/2494fbd975e31ed867b4683dfbd6aa27.mp4?t=1745946268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Social Interaction:</i> Every inhabitant has different needs, desires and dreams. Create a society where everyone can find their place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/912b7ad1979ebb8f5afbaa1f70e411bf.poster.avif?t=1745946268\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/912b7ad1979ebb8f5afbaa1f70e411bf.webm?t=1745946268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/extras/912b7ad1979ebb8f5afbaa1f70e411bf.mp4?t=1745946268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian Village Simulator on Mars combines your fantasies of space and your love of earth into an incredibly detailed and vibrant world. Build your Martian dream village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to take on the challenge and create a new legacy in the most unusual colony on Mars?</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Grandpa Maxim","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/905b38b921f90786ba4d757111b49ccdbd3cf8ba.jpg"},{"name":"Alice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/afae542935de6d0bc5587985f76fd8c7d13332a9.jpg"},{"name":"That's it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/b3fde7668473fe3c20d5d0bb2cc5526dc4881191.jpg"},{"name":"Chairman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/de059f4d6db4d20dd2c35ee6b5730a7fb3d96389.jpg"},{"name":"Doctor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/b42fdb076f091e09538ce637a128500ff8e3e6b6.jpg"},{"name":"Tractor driver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/dee09f4d535ba354fd85022fef581c296b029d8c.jpg"},{"name":"Lumberjack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/9c5507da62928ac492520f12c72e05a1c4025645.jpg"},{"name":"Carpenter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/5d3ef306704fca687341474225b5caa3142c9e20.jpg"},{"name":"Refueling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/59ab9959fd43748652d7d861b8856c3b3192fbfa.jpg"},{"name":"Baba Yaga","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800460/307ffc343f996f6b1dee0842b93da90d8f95911b.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2800460?t=1745946268","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745946268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745946268","capsule_i